    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3092980/extras/80e453475b5ab2dab95221247db49a17.poster.avif?t=1753199962\" width=560 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3092980/extras/80e453475b5ab2dab95221247db49a17.webm?t=1753199962\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3092980/extras/80e453475b5ab2dab95221247db49a17.mp4?t=1753199962\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Build the mall of your dreams \u2014 and feel the reward every step of the way.</strong><br>Take full control as you turn a quiet, empty shopping center into a thriving hub of life and profit. Stock shelves, set your own prices, handle payments, hire and train staff, and manage everything down to the finest detail. Every decision counts \u2014 and every success is truly yours.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3092980/extras/bbd66ae4dbcea0ab906efb61b4920463.poster.avif?t=1753199962\" width=568 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3092980/extras/bbd66ae4dbcea0ab906efb61b4920463.webm?t=1753199962\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3092980/extras/bbd66ae4dbcea0ab906efb61b4920463.mp4?t=1753199962\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience the satisfaction of watching your stores fill with customers, your profits grow, and your mall expand from a few humble shops into a bustling commercial empire. Whether you're handling logistics, catching shoplifters, or optimizing store layouts, you're always moving forward \u2014 and it feels <i>amazing</i>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Design every corner of your space, manage deliveries from local and online suppliers, and find the perfect balance between efficiency and creativity. Upcoming features like online ordering and deliveries will push your empire to the next level.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>This is your mall. Your strategy. Your success.</strong><br>And every moment you play, you\u2019ll feel just how far you\u2019ve come.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3092980/extras/cc327de708d2575a6e7362cf1c4ebce3.poster.avif?t=1753199962\" width=568 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3092980/extras/cc327de708d2575a6e7362cf1c4ebce3.webm?t=1753199962\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3092980/extras/cc327de708d2575a6e7362cf1c4ebce3.mp4?t=1753199962\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3092980/extras/030eb2a3c260319af5bb152fc5d99f32.avif?t=1753199962\" width=618 height=80 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Full control at your fingertips</strong>: Manage your entire mall through a modern tablet interface! Use various apps to track your revenue, expenses, and handle essential management tasks with ease.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Expanding store network</strong>: Start with a simple store and grow your mall by unlocking and opening more stores! Each store has its own development levels, unlocking new products and furnishings as you progress.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Strategic pricing and customer reactions</strong>: Set the right price for your products and watch how your customers react. If your prices are too high, they'll walk away, but if you find the right balance, your profits will soar!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Advertising revenue and vending machines</strong>: Set up billboards and place various vending machines throughout the mall. The more visitors you attract, the higher your advertising revenue and sales will be!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dynamic quality index</strong>: Boost your mall's appeal with decorative elements like plants and benches to increase foot traffic and customer satisfaction. Every detail contributes to the success of your shopping center!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Staff management</strong>: Hire sales assistants, cleaners, and vending machine refillers! Upgrade your staff's abilities to make them more efficient and faster in handling their tasks.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Comprehensive financial analysis</strong>: Monitor your mall\u2019s financial status with the central diagram. Review daily income and expenses to ensure you\u2019re making the best strategic decisions for growth.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Challenging levels and activities</strong>: Complete a variety of tasks and reach new levels to unlock exciting new features. Open new stores, install more billboards, and upgrade the mall\u2019s infrastructure to keep your visitors coming back for more!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >    </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Why should you play Mall Manager Simulator?</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mall Manager Simulator is a rich and engaging management game that challenges your strategic thinking. Step by step, you\u2019ll develop your mall, with every decision you make shaping the future of your shopping empire. Can you become the most successful mall manager and build the city's greatest shopping destination?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dive into the challenge and transform your mall into a shopping paradise! Download Mall Manager Simulator now and start your journey toward becoming the best mall manager in town!</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3092980/extras/80e453475b5ab2dab95221247db49a17.poster.avif?t=1753199962\" width=560 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3092980/extras/80e453475b5ab2dab95221247db49a17.webm?t=1753199962\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3092980/extras/80e453475b5ab2dab95221247db49a17.mp4?t=1753199962\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Build the mall of your dreams \u2014 and feel the reward every step of the way.</strong><br>Take full control as you turn a quiet, empty shopping center into a thriving hub of life and profit. Stock shelves, set your own prices, handle payments, hire and train staff, and manage everything down to the finest detail. Every decision counts \u2014 and every success is truly yours.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3092980/extras/bbd66ae4dbcea0ab906efb61b4920463.poster.avif?t=1753199962\" width=568 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3092980/extras/bbd66ae4dbcea0ab906efb61b4920463.webm?t=1753199962\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3092980/extras/bbd66ae4dbcea0ab906efb61b4920463.mp4?t=1753199962\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience the satisfaction of watching your stores fill with customers, your profits grow, and your mall expand from a few humble shops into a bustling commercial empire. Whether you're handling logistics, catching shoplifters, or optimizing store layouts, you're always moving forward \u2014 and it feels <i>amazing</i>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Design every corner of your space, manage deliveries from local and online suppliers, and find the perfect balance between efficiency and creativity. Upcoming features like online ordering and deliveries will push your empire to the next level.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>This is your mall. Your strategy. Your success.</strong><br>And every moment you play, you\u2019ll feel just how far you\u2019ve come.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3092980/extras/cc327de708d2575a6e7362cf1c4ebce3.poster.avif?t=1753199962\" width=568 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3092980/extras/cc327de708d2575a6e7362cf1c4ebce3.webm?t=1753199962\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3092980/extras/cc327de708d2575a6e7362cf1c4ebce3.mp4?t=1753199962\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3092980/extras/030eb2a3c260319af5bb152fc5d99f32.avif?t=1753199962\" width=618 height=80 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Full control at your fingertips</strong>: Manage your entire mall through a modern tablet interface! Use various apps to track your revenue, expenses, and handle essential management tasks with ease.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Expanding store network</strong>: Start with a simple store and grow your mall by unlocking and opening more stores! Each store has its own development levels, unlocking new products and furnishings as you progress.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Strategic pricing and customer reactions</strong>: Set the right price for your products and watch how your customers react. If your prices are too high, they'll walk away, but if you find the right balance, your profits will soar!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Advertising revenue and vending machines</strong>: Set up billboards and place various vending machines throughout the mall. The more visitors you attract, the higher your advertising revenue and sales will be!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dynamic quality index</strong>: Boost your mall's appeal with decorative elements like plants and benches to increase foot traffic and customer satisfaction. Every detail contributes to the success of your shopping center!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Staff management</strong>: Hire sales assistants, cleaners, and vending machine refillers! Upgrade your staff's abilities to make them more efficient and faster in handling their tasks.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Comprehensive financial analysis</strong>: Monitor your mall\u2019s financial status with the central diagram. Review daily income and expenses to ensure you\u2019re making the best strategic decisions for growth.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Challenging levels and activities</strong>: Complete a variety of tasks and reach new levels to unlock exciting new features. Open new stores, install more billboards, and upgrade the mall\u2019s infrastructure to keep your visitors coming back for more!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >    </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Why should you play Mall Manager Simulator?</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mall Manager Simulator is a rich and engaging management game that challenges your strategic thinking. Step by step, you\u2019ll develop your mall, with every decision you make shaping the future of your shopping empire. Can you become the most successful mall manager and build the city's greatest shopping destination?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dive into the challenge and transform your mall into a shopping paradise! Download Mall Manager Simulator now and start your journey toward becoming the best mall manager in town!</p>",
